# fib.lam - fib(21) on the Categorical Abstract Machine (cam.asm).
#
#   ./run fib.lam                                ->  10946
#
# The syntax of ../graph/fib.lam, and the doubly recursive definition, so it
# makes 35,421 calls. fib(21) = 10946 is the largest that fits in a 15-bit
# number (at most 16383).

fib n = if (< n 2) n (+ (fib (- n 1)) (fib (- n 2)));

fib 21
